ent-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/android.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Android notes from daily use: adb, flashing, the emulator, APK install, hibernate\/force-stop, and rooting.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tAndroid notes from daily use: adb, flashing, the emulator, APK install, hibernate\/force-stop, and rooting.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>ADB<\/h4>\n\t<h4>Android<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAndroid is a Linux-based open source operating system from Google, not as in free beer: there is a licensing fee attached. Google acquired Android in 2005. To use Google's trademark \"Android\", a specification must be satisfied.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Archive<\/h4>\n\t<h4>Emulator<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tList Android Virtual Devices.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Flashing<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFlash procedure.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Hibernate and freeze<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApplication manager: force-stop a package, then start it again.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Install APK<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: <code class='inline'>adb remount<\/code> remounts the system partition.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Android notes<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCreate file: <code class='inline'>.nomedia<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Rooting<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: unlocking the bootloader and installing SuperUser replaces system recovery state.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-titl